      "props": {
        "text": "Shipped an English fork of MiroFish — Neo4j + Ollama local stack, billed as \"offline multi-agent simulation & prediction engine.\" Same ancestor as Miroshark, different bet: went local-first, no AMM, no X/Reddit social layer, no x402. Someone found the MiroFish lineage worth rebuilding — thesis validated. Their path is the opposite of ours: local, closed, no market layer. Miroshark's edge holds: cloud-native, real X/Reddit personas, AMM belief drift, director mode, $1/<10min, x402-native. Watch for stars/community traction."
